        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By offering a GWB inside a retirement plan, we provide plan sponsors a solution that gives participants the ability to participate in the market and receive guaranteed income for life while still maintaining access to their plan account balance.",
        "start_character": 44275,
        "end_character": 44520
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "These products are available both to retirement plans where we provide plan recordkeeping services and those where we do not.",
        "start_character": 44521,
        "end_character": 44646
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our business segments, we sell a wide range of wealth accumulation, wealth protection, group protection and retirement income products and solutions.",
        "start_character": 238,
        "end_character": 395
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer a broad array of plan services including plan recordkeeping, compliance testing, participant education and trust and custodial services through our affiliated trust company, Lincoln Financial Group Trust Company.",
        "start_character": 39243,
        "end_character": 39469
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide insured coverage for, as well as administrative services for employer self-funded, state-specific statutory disability and paid family leave programs.",
        "start_character": 31822,
        "end_character": 31988
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are monitoring all potential changes and evaluating the potential impact they could have on our product offerings, financial condition and results of operations.",
        "start_character": 65864,
        "end_character": 66028
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We design and actively manage the features and structure of our guaranteed benefit riders to maintain a competitive suite of products consistent with profitability and risk management goals.",
        "start_character": 10759,
        "end_character": 10949
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We invest in our employees’ futures by offering market-competitive compensation and a broad range of health and wellness programs as well as retirement savings, financial health and protection plans.",
        "start_character": 104070,
        "end_character": 104269
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a robust portfolio of absence management services to help employers manage their state and federal family medical and company leave programs (paid and unpaid), as well as accommodation services that help employers identify accommodations that could be made to help claimants return to work (e.g., assistive devices, ergonomic assessments, etc.).",
        "start_character": 32017,
        "end_character": 32371
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer a suite of employer-sponsored supplemental health insurance products designed for employees and their covered dependents.",
        "start_character": 32870,
        "end_character": 33000
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000059558-26-000016",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000059558-26-000016-e7267a3e9484117e",
        "accession_number": "0000059558-26-000016",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer insured coverage for, as well as administrative services for employer self-funded, short- and long-term employer-sponsored group and voluntary disability plans, which protect an employee against loss of wages due to illness or injury.",
